<title>USA: Canada has solid economic recovery - Martin.</title>
<headline>Canada has solid economic recovery - Martin.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's economic recovery is solid but it is too soon to cut taxes, Finance Minister Paul Martin said on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;Economic recovery is firmly anchored. There is no doubt that lower interest rates are the main reason,&quot; he told reporters at the start of the IMF's Interim Committee meeting.</p>
<p>Martin noted the housing and manufacturing sectors had improved considerably along with competitiveness, adding: &quot;But now is not the time for broad-based tax cuts&quot;</p>
</text>
